/E (Department Module : The Department Module provides separate dashboards for Technical Support, Billing, Account Support, and General Inquiry. Tickets are automatically routed to the appropriate department based on the AI-predicted category. Department staff can view AI predictions, review similar historical tickets, respond to customers, update ticket status, and record final resolution details.)
